      10 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استجاف</span></b>  and 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِسْتَجْوَفَ</span></b>  <i>It</i> (a thing) <i>became
wide, spacious,</i> or <i>ample.</i> (S, K.) [See also 1,
first sentence.] ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استجافهُ</span> <i>He found it</i> (a place)
to be <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَجْوَف</span> [i. e. <i>hollow,</i> or <i>empty within;</i> or
<i>wide, spacious,</i> or <i>ample</i>]. (O, L, K.)

